WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.725
Trace follows each image from release to checksum, to its Figma frames, to the docs slot that embeds it, and checks the file on disk. No problems in either image.

00:10.705 --> 00:14.730
The inventory records the exported image's checksum.

00:14.710 --> 00:21.310
The docs branch serves the same bytes: the checksum of the image in the swap commit matches exactly.

00:21.290 --> 00:38.065
Lookup lists what is still unverified. Here, nothing is published, so there's no published URL or published checksum yet. After a real publish, record publication downloads the served image and records its checksum, and the record moves to verified.
